The two halves compose rather than overlap: the schema rejects a kind it doesn't know at load time (I confirmed — mutating kind to garbage throws ADAPTER_PROFILE_SCHEMA_INVALID before the test can even see it), and the table catches the opposite direction, a kind added to the enum but never classified. I noted that dependency in the comment since the two now have to move together.

